    "idealized_steady_state_tokens_per_second": "training tokens / (median non-diagnostic step time x steps): removes all jitter, an optimistic upper bound",
    "measured_epoch_end_seconds": "end of the last optimizer.step() to the end timestamp taken right after this epoch's history row was written: [BN] recalibration, full-train and dev evaluation, the trainer's epoch-end diagnostics (they differ by arm), the best checkpoint and the history write",
    "measured_sgd_phase_seconds": "wall time from the previous epoch's end timestamp (taken right after its history row was written; epoch 1: the trainer call) to the end of this epoch's last optimizer.step(); includes step diagnostics, the progress line, the previous epoch's checkpoint_last.pt write and, for epoch 1, trainer set-up",
